From b2ae07d407c159486ba6ba883a5b864e9d05bf14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William <william@example.com>
Date: Mon, 30 Mar 2026 19:35:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Make site fully responsive for mobile/tablet/desktop
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Responsive header with scaled logo and hidden tagline on mobile
- Hero section with mobile-friendly padding, 2x2 stats grid, scaled images
- All section padding scales down on mobile (py-16 sm:py-20 md:py-24)
- Card grids: 1-col mobile → 2-col tablet → 3-col desktop
- Footer overflow fix, break-all for long email links
- State pages (Alabama, Georgia) get same responsive treatment
- Remove @vercel/analytics import (not on Cloudflare Pages)
- Add overflow-x:hidden to prevent horizontal scroll

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
